# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Instale pelo marketplace do Cursor, se estiver disponível, ou use a [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) acima com `--agent cursor`. Veja a [documentação de plugins do Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) para mais informações.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "O Bob não tem etapa de plugin/marketplace — ele lê os arquivos `SKILL.md` diretamente de `.bob/skills/` em um projeto clonado. O repositório cria links simbólicos das skills para `.bob/skills/<name>`  então clonar o repositório é suficiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Você também pode instalar com a [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) acima, usando `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Clonar / Copiar {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Se o seu agente não oferece suporte a um plugin nativo ou à skills CLI, clone este repositório e copie o diretório da skill desejada para o diretório de skills compatível com o agente:\n"

